xz 5.8.4 for Python code cells: lzma (liblzma only) (docs/adr/0180)

Source:  URL
Version: VERSION
SHA256:  SHA256 (tarball verified against the release's GPG signature by Lasse Collin, key 3690C240CE51B4670D30AD1C38EE757D69184620)
License: COPYING.0BSD (liblzma: BSD Zero Clause); COPYING (package overview)

The tarball is not committed. scripts/cpython_runtime.sh reads URL and SHA256
from this directory, verifies the tarball in CPYTHON_DEPS_DIR (default
build/deps; `make fetch-cpython` downloads it, a hash mismatch always
fails), builds a static library and links it into the embedded CPython runtime
of the `tny` executable only; libtny and wasm do not contain it.

To update: change VERSION, URL and SHA256 together from the upstream release
metadata, refresh the license file, rebuild, and rerun `make test`.
